  {
    "id": 1019003030090,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──プロデューサー、\r\nホントにいいの？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "019",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "0008",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030100,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "車で送ってもらうとか……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030110,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "プロデューサーも知ってると思うけど\r\nうちん家、結構遠いよ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……もうこんな時間だしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "遠いならなおさら、\r\nちゃんと自宅まで送り届けないと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030120,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……ありがとね、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、それでさ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030130,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──愛依は、何で悩んでる？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030140,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "へ……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "少し前からよく、\r\n何か考えてるみたいだったから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030150,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "…………\r\nそう、なのかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030160,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うち、そう見える？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "不安なことがあれば\r\nなんでも言ってくれていいんだぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030170,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うーん……\r\n自分でもよくわかってないっていうか",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030180,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "なんか、上手く言葉には\r\n出来ないカンジ？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……愛依は、『G.R.A.D.』\r\n参加してよかったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030190,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "えっ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大きな番組だし、チャンスでもある",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、オファーを受けたこと\r\nもし愛依の本意じゃなかったのなら──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030200,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "いやいや、\r\nそんなわけないじゃん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030210,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "参加できてよかったって思ってるし\r\nもっと、頑張らなきゃって思ってるよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030220,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ただ、ひとりだとどうしようって\r\n迷う時もあって──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030230,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……愛依？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030240,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──そっか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030250,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "いつも、あさひちゃんと\r\n冬優子ちゃんがいたから……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030260,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "なんか、よくわかんなくなっても\r\nふたりといれば……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900303/1019003030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003030270,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "大丈夫って、思ってたみたい",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
